YOU ALL KNOW, IN 2021 WE HAD A

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.862
MAJOR OIL SPILL OFF THE COAST OF

00:15:29.928 --> 00:15:30.829
HUNTINGTON BEACH, WHICH I

00:15:30.896 --> 00:15:31.930
REPRESENT. THOSE RESPONSIBLE FOR

00:15:31.997 --> 00:15:33.899
THAT SPILL ARE BEING HELD TO

00:15:33.966 --> 00:15:34.900
ACCOUNT FINANCIALLY.

00:15:34.967 --> 00:15:37.236
UNFORTUNATELY FURTHER UP THE

00:15:37.303 --> 00:15:38.370
COAST, OTHER OPERATORS HAVE

00:15:38.437 --> 00:15:40.139
FOUND IT IN THEIR BEST INTEREST

00:15:40.205 --> 00:15:41.373
TO DECLARE BANKRUPTCY AND WALK

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.809
AWAY FROM DOZENS OF UNPLUGGED

00:15:43.876 --> 00:15:44.810
OIL WELLS AND ASSOCIATED

00:15:44.877 --> 00:15:45.377
EQUIPMENT AND INFRASTRUCTURE

00:15:45.444 --> 00:15:48.147
WITH A $200 MILLION HIT TO THE

00:15:48.213 --> 00:15:50.549
GENERAL FUND, RESULTING. THIS IS

00:15:50.616 --> 00:15:51.483
UNFORTUNATELY PART OF AN

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.584
ESTABLISHED INDUSTRY MODEL WHERE

00:15:52.651 --> 00:15:54.987
MAJOR OIL WELL PRODUCERS OR

00:15:55.054 --> 00:15:56.055
OWNERS SELL THEIR WELLS TO AN

00:15:56.121 --> 00:15:57.556
INDEPENDENT PRODUCER, WHO THEN

00:15:57.623 --> 00:15:59.358
SELLS TO SMALLER ONE, AND SO ON.

00:15:59.425 --> 00:16:00.626
UNTIL THE LAST COMPANY DECLARES

00:16:00.693 --> 00:16:01.660
BANKRUPTCY. WALKING AWAY WITH

00:16:01.727 --> 00:16:04.063
AND LEAVING STATE TAXPAYERS ON

00:16:04.129 --> 00:16:05.798
THE HOOK FOR WHAT CAN BE

00:16:05.864 --> 00:16:07.333
MULTI-MILLION DOLLAR, WELL,

00:16:07.399 --> 00:16:08.400
CLEANUPS. THIS RESOLUTION ASKS

00:16:08.467 --> 00:16:10.302
THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT TO MAKE

00:16:10.369 --> 00:16:12.171
SURE THAT AN OIL WELL BANKRUPTCY

00:16:12.237 --> 00:16:13.739
WILL NOT ADVERSELY AFFECT

00:16:13.806 --> 00:16:14.740
CALIFORNIA STATE TAXPAYERS. I

