00:35:04.068 --> 00:35:06.070
AND OF COURSE, I AND SO MANY

00:35:06.137 --> 00:35:07.905
OTHERS ARE SORRY FOR YOUR

00:35:07.972 --> 00:35:09.240
TREMENDOUS LOSS. IT'S OUR LOSS

00:35:09.307 --> 00:35:12.777
AS WELL. KNOWN AFFECTIONATELY AS

00:35:12.844 --> 00:35:14.045
TIM, HE WAS A CHERISHED FATHER,

00:35:14.111 --> 00:35:15.046
GRANDFATHER, BROTHER, UNCLE AND

00:35:15.112 --> 00:35:17.248
FRIEND. HIS LIFE WAS DEFINED BY

00:35:17.315 --> 00:35:18.382
HIS COMMITMENT TO HIS FAMILY,

00:35:18.449 --> 00:35:20.751
COMMUNITY AND HIS COUNTRY. HE

00:35:20.818 --> 00:35:23.621
WAS VERY, VERY COMMITTED TO HIS

00:35:23.688 --> 00:35:25.490
FORM OF PUBLIC SERVICE. HE WAS

00:35:25.556 --> 00:35:27.758
BORN IN WABASHA, MINNESOTA IN

00:35:27.825 --> 00:35:30.895
1945. HE GRADUATED FROM THE US

00:35:30.962 --> 00:35:33.498
NAVAL ACADEMY, US NAVAL ACADEMY

00:35:33.564 --> 00:35:36.400
IN 1967, AND EMBARKED ON A

00:35:36.467 --> 00:35:38.636
NEARLY 30 YEAR CAREER IN THE

00:35:38.703 --> 00:35:39.737
NAVY. HOPING I CAN HAVE

00:35:39.804 --> 00:35:41.973
ATTENTION, MR. PRESIDENT, THIS

00:35:42.039 --> 00:35:45.276
IS A DISTINGUISHED VETERAN AND A

00:35:45.343 --> 00:35:48.746
GREAT LEADER, NOT JUST FOR MY

00:35:48.813 --> 00:35:49.881
AREA, BUT FOR THE ENTIRE

00:35:49.947 --> 00:35:52.416
COUNTRY. AFTER HIS 30 YEAR

00:35:52.483 --> 00:35:54.352
CAREER IN THE NAVY, HE SERVED AS

00:35:54.418 --> 00:35:55.653
A P-3 PILOT UNDER, TOOK THREE

00:35:55.720 --> 00:35:56.854
COMBAT TOURS DURING THE VIETNAM

00:35:56.921 --> 00:35:58.956
WAR AND HELD SEVERAL SENIOR

00:35:59.023 --> 00:35:59.824
LEADERSHIP POSITIONS IN THE

00:35:59.891 --> 00:36:03.027
MILITARY. HE FOUND HIS WAY TO

00:36:03.094 --> 00:36:05.530
SAN JOSE DURING HIS NAVAL CAREER

00:36:05.596 --> 00:36:06.731
, A CITY THAT WOULD BECOME HIS

00:36:06.797 --> 00:36:08.599
HOME FOR NEARLY 50 YEARS. IN

00:36:08.666 --> 00:36:09.667
ADDITION TO ATTENDING THE US

00:36:09.734 --> 00:36:11.903
NAVAL ACADEMY, HE ALSO GRADUATED

00:36:11.969 --> 00:36:13.170
FROM THE JOHN F KENNEDY SCHOOL

00:36:13.237 --> 00:36:14.739
OF GOVERNMENT, HARVARD

00:36:14.805 --> 00:36:18.009
UNIVERSITY, AND HE WAS A FORMER

00:36:18.075 --> 00:36:19.010
COURSE PRESIDENT AT THE NATO

00:36:19.076 --> 00:36:21.445
DEFENSE COLLEGE FROM 1991 TO

00:36:21.512 --> 00:36:24.982
1992. AFTER RETIRING FROM THE

00:36:25.049 --> 00:36:28.185
NAVY AS A CAPTAIN IN 1994, HE

00:36:28.252 --> 00:36:29.387
RETURNED TO SAN JOSE TO PURSUE A

00:36:29.453 --> 00:36:31.222
CAREER AS A CORPORATE NONPROFIT

00:36:31.289 --> 00:36:32.223
EXECUTIVE. HE HELD POSITIONS

00:36:32.290 --> 00:36:34.425
SUCH AS CEO OF THE SILICON

00:36:34.492 --> 00:36:35.426
VALLEY DEFENSE AND SPACE

00:36:35.493 --> 00:36:37.728
CONSORTIUM, THE CEO OF THE

00:36:37.795 --> 00:36:38.863
SILICON VALLEY GLOBAL TRADING

00:36:38.930 --> 00:36:41.165
CENTER, THE PROGRAM DIRECTOR OF

00:36:41.232 --> 00:36:44.802
GREEN CHANGE CALIFORNIA, WHICH

00:36:44.869 --> 00:36:46.771
IS THE PLACE I FIRST MET TIM. HE

00:36:46.837 --> 00:36:48.773
WAS HIGHLY ENGAGED IN THE

00:36:48.839 --> 00:36:50.541
COMMUNITY, SERVING AS A BOARD

00:36:50.608 --> 00:36:51.676
MEMBER FOR BOTH THE SAN JOSE

00:36:51.742 --> 00:36:54.211
SYMPHONY AND ALSO THE SAN JOSE

00:36:54.278 --> 00:36:55.479
POLICE FOUNDATION. HIS REGULAR

00:36:55.546 --> 00:36:56.480
PRESENCE AT LOCAL GOVERNMENT

00:36:56.547 --> 00:36:58.683
MEETINGS AND COMMUNITY EVENTS

00:36:58.749 --> 00:36:59.750
EARNED HIM THE REPUTATION OF A

00:36:59.817 --> 00:37:00.918
RESPECTED CIVIC LEADER, KNOWN

00:37:00.985 --> 00:37:02.687
FOR HIS TIRELESS COMMITMENT AND

00:37:02.753 --> 00:37:05.089
BOUNDLESS ENERGY. TIM'S REAL

00:37:05.156 --> 00:37:09.327
CLAIM TO FAME AS I GOT TO KNOW

00:37:09.393 --> 00:37:11.295
HIM IN THE PLACE I THINK HE WAS

00:37:11.362 --> 00:37:12.463
MOST COMFORTABLE WITH, SISTER

00:37:12.530 --> 00:37:15.333
CITIES INTERNATIONAL. ON MARCH

00:37:15.399 --> 00:37:18.336
14TH OF THIS YEAR, SISTER CITIES

00:37:18.402 --> 00:37:19.303
INTERNATIONAL MOURNED HIS LOSS

00:37:19.370 --> 00:37:22.073
AS A REMARKABLE MEMBER OF OUR

00:37:22.139 --> 00:37:23.841
COMMUNITY. HE HAD BEEN CHAIRMAN

00:37:23.908 --> 00:37:26.477
OF THE HONORARY BOARD OF

00:37:26.544 --> 00:37:29.080
DIRECTORS, CHAIRMAN EMERITUS,

00:37:29.146 --> 00:37:30.214
GLOBAL ENVOY AND FIRST CHAIRMAN

00:37:30.281 --> 00:37:32.283
OF THE SISTER CITIES

00:37:32.350 --> 00:37:32.850
INTERNATIONAL FOUNDATION. HE

00:37:32.917 --> 00:37:35.953
LEFT AN INCREDIBLE MARK ON THAT

00:37:36.020 --> 00:37:36.988
ORGANIZATION. HE SERVED AS

00:37:37.054 --> 00:37:39.090
COUNTRY REPRESENTATIVE TO

00:37:39.156 --> 00:37:42.293
AUSTRALIA, IRELAND, ITALY, SAUDI

