INSPIRATION TO MANY. I KNOW IT

00:39:27.364 --> 00:39:28.299
WILL CONTINUE TO BE AN

00:39:28.365 --> 00:39:29.867
INSPIRATION TO HIS SON, TO THE

00:39:29.934 --> 00:39:31.736
FAMILY MEMBERS WHO ARE HERE, WHO

00:39:31.802 --> 00:39:34.238
ARE HERE, AND TO THE EXTENDED

