TO THE QUIGLEY FAMILY AND ASK

00:39:57.161 --> 00:39:58.329
THAT YOU BRING HIS NAME FORWARD

00:39:58.395 --> 00:39:59.897
SO HE CAN BE PROPERLY

00:39:59.964 --> 00:40:00.531
MEMORIALIZED. MEMORIALIZED. NEXT

