UP IS SENATOR PORTANTINO.

00:40:07.071 --> 00:40:10.741
MEMBERS, I RISE TODAY. SADLY TO

00:40:10.808 --> 00:40:11.942
ADJOURN IN THE MEMORY OF RAUL

00:40:12.009 --> 00:40:13.978
PORTO. AFTER IMMIGRATING FROM

00:40:14.044 --> 00:40:15.679
MANZANILLA, CUBA, IN SEARCH OF A

00:40:15.746 --> 00:40:18.182
BETTER LIFE, HE SETTLED IN LOS

00:40:18.249 --> 00:40:20.351
ANGELES, WHERE ALL IN HIS LATE

00:40:20.417 --> 00:40:22.286
WIFE ROSA, WHO WAS ALSO A BAKER

00:40:22.353 --> 00:40:24.021
AND CO-FOUNDER OF THEIR

00:40:24.088 --> 00:40:25.055
WONDERFUL BAKERY, WHICH THEY

00:40:25.122 --> 00:40:29.560
STARTED THEIR CHAIN IN 1976.

00:40:29.627 --> 00:40:30.661
TOGETHER THEY HELPED GENERATIONS

00:40:30.728 --> 00:40:33.063
OF CUBAN, CUBAN IMMIGRANTS FIND

00:40:33.130 --> 00:40:34.832
A TASTE OF HOME AND POPULARIZE

00:40:34.899 --> 00:40:36.600
REGIONAL SPECIALTIES SUCH AS

00:40:36.667 --> 00:40:38.302
STUFFED AND FRIED POTATO BALLS

00:40:38.369 --> 00:40:40.504
AND PRESSED CUBAN SANDWICHES.

00:40:40.571 --> 00:40:43.107
LATER ON, THE PORTO'S EXPANDED

00:40:43.174 --> 00:40:44.141
THEIR BUSINESS BEYOND CUBAN

00:40:44.208 --> 00:40:46.443
PASTRIES TO SERVE TREATS THAT

00:40:46.510 --> 00:40:47.511
APPEALED TO A NUMBER OF

00:40:47.578 --> 00:40:49.747
CULTURES, INCLUDING, DANISHES,

00:40:49.814 --> 00:40:50.748
FRUIT TARTS, MUFFINS, AND MANY,

00:40:50.815 --> 00:40:53.484
MANY MORE. IN 1982, PORTO'S

00:40:53.551 --> 00:40:56.987
RELOCATED TO GLENDALE AND

00:40:57.054 --> 00:40:58.055
EVENTUALLY FURTHER EXPANDED TO

00:40:58.122 --> 00:41:01.392
BURBANK AND BUENA PARK, WEST

00:41:01.458 --> 00:41:03.661
COVINA AND NORTHRIDGE. KNOWN FOR

00:41:03.727 --> 00:41:04.829
HIS HUMBLE NATURE, RAUL BALANCED

00:41:04.895 --> 00:41:07.531
HIS ROLES AS A DEVOTED HUSBAND,

00:41:07.598 --> 00:41:08.332
FATHER, AND BUSINESSMAN,

00:41:08.399 --> 00:41:10.868
INSPIRING ALL WHO KNEW HIM WITH

00:41:10.935 --> 00:41:12.036
HIS PASSION AND HIS COMMITMENT

00:41:12.102 --> 00:41:15.272
IN HIS LATER YEARS, OUR WOOL

00:41:15.339 --> 00:41:17.408
FOUND IMMENSE JOY IN SPENDING

00:41:17.474 --> 00:41:18.442
TIME WITH HIS GRANDCHILDREN AND

00:41:18.509 --> 00:41:21.045
WATCHING THE NEXT GENERATION OF

00:41:21.111 --> 00:41:22.213
HIS FAMILY GROW AND EXCEL. RAUL

00:41:22.279 --> 00:41:24.348
AND ROSA ARE SURVIVED BY

00:41:24.415 --> 00:41:25.382
SURVIVED BY GENERATIONS OF

00:41:25.449 --> 00:41:27.852
PORTO'S, INCLUDING MANY

00:41:27.918 --> 00:41:30.287
GRANDCHILDREN. THEIR THREE

00:41:30.354 --> 00:41:31.288
CHILDREN BEATRICE, RAUL JR AND

00:41:31.355 --> 00:41:33.891
MARGARITA, ALL GREW UP HELPING

00:41:33.958 --> 00:41:35.693
THEIR PARENTS IN THE BAKERY AND

00:41:35.759 --> 00:41:37.094
WENT ON TO RUN THE BUSINESSES

00:41:37.161 --> 00:41:38.762
THEMSELVES. HE HAD A TREMENDOUS

00:41:38.829 --> 00:41:40.998
LOVE FOR FAMILY AND TRULY AN

00:41:41.065 --> 00:41:43.834
AMERICAN SUCCESS STORY, AN

00:41:43.901 --> 00:41:45.669
AMERICAN DREAM. HE CAME HERE TO

00:41:45.736 --> 00:41:47.004
PURSUE A BETTER LIFE FOR HIS

00:41:47.071 --> 00:41:48.172
FAMILY, AND THROUGH HIS HARD

00:41:48.239 --> 00:41:50.608
WORK AND PERSEVERANCE, HE

00:41:50.674 --> 00:41:51.709
CREATED THAT WORK, PASSED IT ON

00:41:51.775 --> 00:41:54.044
TO HIS CHILDREN. BEATRICE IS A

00:41:54.111 --> 00:41:55.946
FIXTURE IN GLENDALE. I JUST WAS

00:41:56.013 --> 00:41:58.249
AT AN EVENT THE OTHER DAY IN

00:41:58.315 --> 00:41:59.416
BURBANK AND THERE WAS THE PORTO

00:41:59.483 --> 00:42:00.651
FAMILY DONATING FOOD TO SUPPORT

00:42:00.718 --> 00:42:02.519
THE COMMUNITY. THIS IS A FAMILY

00:42:02.586 --> 00:42:06.590
THAT CAME HERE TO DO GOOD THINGS

00:42:06.657 --> 00:42:07.725
, SUCCEED, AND TURN THAT SUCCESS

00:42:07.791 --> 00:42:10.728
INTO COMMUNITY SERVICE. AND I

00:42:10.794 --> 00:42:12.563
PROUDLY STAND TO ASK THIS BODY

00:42:12.630 --> 00:42:13.931
TO ADJOURN IN HIS MEMORY. PLEASE

00:42:13.998 --> 00:42:14.932
SEND OUR CONDOLENCES TO THE

00:42:14.999 --> 00:42:18.535
FAMILY AND BRING HIS NAME

00:42:18.602 --> 00:42:21.338
FORWARD TO THE DESK. SENATOR

00:42:21.405 --> 00:42:22.539
DURAZZO, I'M SORRY I DIDN'T SEE

00:42:22.606 --> 00:42:24.441
YOU WERE GOING TO SPEAK. I JUST

00:42:24.508 --> 00:42:26.410
WANT TO ADD A COUPLE OF, WORDS

00:42:26.477 --> 00:42:29.747
TO WHAT MY COLLEAGUE SAID, THE

00:42:29.813 --> 00:42:30.881
FIRST LOCATION OF THE PORTO'S

00:42:30.948 --> 00:42:32.650
BAKERIES WAS IN ECHO PARK. MY

00:42:32.716 --> 00:42:34.285
DISTRICT, WHICH IS HOME TO

00:42:34.351 --> 00:42:36.620
THOUSANDS OF CUBAN REFUGEES. AND

00:42:36.687 --> 00:42:38.522
I JUST WANT TO THANK THE PORTO

00:42:38.589 --> 00:42:40.257
FAMILY BECAUSE OF THEIR CIVIC

00:42:40.324 --> 00:42:41.392
AND THEIR BUSINESS CONTRIBUTIONS

00:42:41.458 --> 00:42:43.994
TO LOS ANGELES, AND END BY

00:42:44.061 --> 00:42:47.097
TELLING YOU THAT THE LINES AT

00:42:47.164 --> 00:42:48.299
THE PORTO BAKERY ARE LONG. ALL

00:42:48.365 --> 00:42:51.235
DAY INTO THE EVENING AND LEAVE

00:42:51.302 --> 00:42:53.704
YOU WITH THIS THOUGHT WAWA CHEEZ

00:42:53.771 --> 00:42:56.440
DOODLES, POTATO BALLS, TRES

00:42:56.507 --> 00:42:59.877
LECHES, PLATEAU DE LECHON, ROPA

00:42:59.944 --> 00:43:01.011
VIEJA, EMPANADAS AND OF COURSE,

00:43:01.078 --> 00:43:03.547
THE CORTADITO COFFEE. THANK YOU.

00:43:03.614 --> 00:43:06.517
PLEASE BRING HIS NAME FORWARD TO

00:43:06.583 --> 00:43:07.618
THE DESK SO HE CAN BE

00:43:07.685 --> 00:43:09.954
APPROPRIATELY MEMORIALIZED. AND

00:43:10.020 --> 00:43:13.424
SENATOR BRADFORD, THANK YOU,

00:43:13.490 --> 00:43:17.494
MADAM PRESIDENT. TODAY I RISE IN

00:43:17.561 --> 00:43:18.595
THE MEMORY OF A GREAT

00:43:18.662 --> 00:43:21.131
CALIFORNIAN, A GREAT TEXAN AND A

00:43:21.198 --> 00:43:23.934
GREAT AMERICAN, THAT IN THE

00:43:24.001 --> 00:43:26.837
PERSON OF JAMES JOHNSON, WHO WAS

00:43:26.904 --> 00:43:30.507
AN AMAZING SON, BROTHER, HUSBAND

00:43:30.574 --> 00:43:31.508
, FATHER AND GRANDFATHER, MR.

00:43:31.575 --> 00:43:34.445
JOHNSON WAS BORN IN TEXAS, IN

00:43:34.511 --> 00:43:36.246
CLARKSVILLE, TEXAS, AND HE WAS

00:43:36.313 --> 00:43:37.514
THE FIFTH OF SEVEN CHILDREN BORN

00:43:37.581 --> 00:43:40.050
TO HIS LATE PARENTS, GEORGE AND

00:43:40.117 --> 00:43:41.885
WILLIE MAE JOHNSON. AND AS EVEN

00:43:41.952 --> 00:43:44.054
AS A YOUNG CHILD, HE WAS KNOWN

00:43:44.121 --> 00:43:46.724
AS BEING A MASTERFUL STORY

00:43:46.790 --> 00:43:47.825
TELLER, ENGAGING FOLKS IN ALL

00:43:47.891 --> 00:43:50.527
KINDS OF STORIES, REYES AND

00:43:50.594 --> 00:43:53.697
ACCOLADES AND JUST AMAZING

00:43:53.764 --> 00:43:57.468
PERSON TO KNOW. MR. JOHNSON WAS

00:43:57.534 --> 00:43:59.403
ALSO A VETERAN. HE SERVED IN THE

00:43:59.470 --> 00:44:01.405
NAVY AND HE DID TWO TOURS OF

00:44:01.472 --> 00:44:03.774
DUTY, AND HE WAS STATIONED IN

00:44:03.841 --> 00:44:04.942
JAPAN. AND WHILE STATIONED IN

00:44:05.009 --> 00:44:08.278
JAPAN, MR. JOHNSON OPTED NOT TO

00:44:08.345 --> 00:44:12.383
STAY ON BASE AND TO LIVE IN THE

00:44:12.449 --> 00:44:13.417
COMMUNITY SO HE COULD GET

00:44:13.484 --> 00:44:14.618
IMMERSED IN THE CULTURE BOTH HE

00:44:14.685 --> 00:44:15.886
AND HIS FAMILY. MR. JOHNSON,

00:44:15.953 --> 00:44:18.722
DURING HIS LIFE VISITED OVER 32

00:44:18.789 --> 00:44:21.325
COUNTRIES AND HE ENCOURAGED HIS

00:44:21.392 --> 00:44:22.993
FAMILY TO EXPLORE AND EXPERIENCE

00:44:23.060 --> 00:44:25.496
THE WORLD AS WELL. WHAT MAKES

00:44:25.562 --> 00:44:28.832
MR. JOHNSON SO SPECIAL TO ME? AS

00:44:28.899 --> 00:44:30.434
A YOUNG KID, HIS FAMILY WAS THE

00:44:30.501 --> 00:44:31.668
SECOND AFRICAN AMERICAN FAMILY

00:44:31.735 --> 00:44:33.604
TO MOVE ON MY STREET. AS A YOUNG

00:44:33.670 --> 00:44:35.639
KID, AND HE MOVED THERE WITH HIS

00:44:35.706 --> 00:44:37.908
LATE WIFE, MILDRED, AND HIS FOUR

00:44:37.975 --> 00:44:40.644
DAUGHTERS, FRANCES, JEAN,

00:44:40.711 --> 00:44:43.747
ANNETTE, YOLANDA AND CARLA. MR.

00:44:43.814 --> 00:44:44.882
JOHNSON WAS THE ORIGINAL GIRL

00:44:44.948 --> 00:44:47.951
DAD AND EVEN THOUGH THERE WAS

00:44:48.018 --> 00:44:49.953
NOT A SINGLE BOY FOR ME TO PLAY

00:44:50.020 --> 00:44:51.388
WITH AS A YOUNG KID, WE WELCOMED

00:44:51.455 --> 00:44:52.489
HIM NONETHELESS BECAUSE MR.

00:44:52.556 --> 00:44:53.657
JOHNSON WAS ALWAYS THERE

00:44:53.724 --> 00:44:56.660
ENCOURAGING ALL OF US REGARDLESS

00:44:56.727 --> 00:44:58.662
IF WE WERE BOYS OR GIRLS, TO BE

00:44:58.729 --> 00:45:00.230
THE BEST THAT WE COULD BE, AS

00:45:00.297 --> 00:45:02.166
STATED, THEY WERE THE SECOND

00:45:02.232 --> 00:45:03.367
BLACK FAMILY ON OUR STREET. WE

00:45:03.434 --> 00:45:04.668
HAVE LIVED ACROSS THE STREET

00:45:04.735 --> 00:45:05.803
FROM EACH OTHER FOR 55 YEARS.

00:45:05.869 --> 00:45:08.972
MR. JOHNSON. ALWAYS SHARED HIS

00:45:09.039 --> 00:45:10.107
WISDOM AND ENCOURAGED MANY YOUNG

00:45:10.174 --> 00:45:13.444
PEOPLE AND ADULTS TO BE THE BEST

00:45:13.510 --> 00:45:14.578
THAT THEY COULD BE IN OUR

00:45:14.645 --> 00:45:16.013
COMMUNITY, HE WAS WELL RESPECTED

00:45:16.080 --> 00:45:19.316
AND ALWAYS EAGER TO HELP PEOPLE

00:45:19.383 --> 00:45:20.484
BECOME THE BEST OF THEMSELVES

00:45:20.551 --> 00:45:22.753
WITH INTEGRITY AND PURPOSE. I

00:45:22.820 --> 00:45:24.555
STAND HERE TODAY BECAUSE OF THE

00:45:24.621 --> 00:45:26.323
MANY DISCUSSIONS AND

00:45:26.390 --> 00:45:27.257
ENCOURAGEMENT THAT HE GAVE ME

00:45:27.324 --> 00:45:29.927
DURING MY THE CHALLENGES OF

00:45:29.993 --> 00:45:33.330
BECOMING AN ELECTED OFFICIAL,

00:45:33.397 --> 00:45:34.465
BEING INVOLVED IN THE COMMUNITY,

00:45:34.531 --> 00:45:36.600
AND HE WAS ALWAYS QUICK TO SAY,

00:45:36.667 --> 00:45:38.569
PUT A SIGN IN MY YARD. I NEVER

00:45:38.635 --> 00:45:39.770
HAD TO ASK THEM. HE WOULD JUST

00:45:39.837 --> 00:45:41.839
SAY MANY TIMES, WHERE IS MY

00:45:41.905 --> 00:45:44.441
SIGN? AND THAT'S WHO MR. JOHNSON

00:45:44.508 --> 00:45:45.576
WAS AGAIN. HE SERVED IN THE

00:45:45.642 --> 00:45:47.010
MILITARY, BUT AFTER RETIRING

00:45:47.077 --> 00:45:48.745
FROM THE MILITARY, HE WORKED FOR

00:45:48.812 --> 00:45:50.481
THE US POSTAL SERVICE, NORRIS

00:45:50.547 --> 00:45:53.717
INDUSTRIES, AND HE RETIRED FROM

00:45:53.784 --> 00:45:54.818
REYNOLDS METALS. AGAIN. HE WAS A

00:45:54.885 --> 00:45:58.355
CALM AND QUIET, BUT COMMANDING

00:45:58.422 --> 00:45:58.889
AND RESPECTED INDIVIDUAL.

00:45:58.956 --> 00:46:02.126
WHENEVER HE ENTERED A ROOM OR

00:46:02.192 --> 00:46:03.260
ANY DISCUSSION. I'M BLESSED TO

00:46:03.327 --> 00:46:05.462
HAVE KNOWN HIM FOR THE LAST 55

00:46:05.529 --> 00:46:07.531
YEARS, AND THOUGH HIS PRESENCE

00:46:07.598 --> 00:46:08.599
WILL BE GREATLY MISSED, HIS

00:46:08.665 --> 00:46:09.766
LEGACY WILL LIVE ON THROUGH THE

00:46:09.833 --> 00:46:11.802
MANY LIVES HE'S TOUCHED HIS FOUR

00:46:11.869 --> 00:46:12.703
AMAZING DAUGHTERS, HIS

00:46:12.769 --> 00:46:14.104
GRANDKIDS, AND NOW GREAT

00:46:14.171 --> 00:46:15.939
GRANDKIDS. MEMBERS, I ASK YOU TO

00:46:16.006 --> 00:46:17.641
JOIN IN MEMORY THE, ADJOURN IN

00:46:17.708 --> 00:46:20.611
MEMORY OF JAMES JOHNSON. THANK

00:46:20.677 --> 00:46:21.678
YOU. SENATOR, PLEASE ACCEPT THE

00:46:21.745 --> 00:46:24.014
SENATE. CONDOLENCES TO THE

00:46:24.081 --> 00:46:25.649
FAMILY AND THE FRIENDS. AND

00:46:25.716 --> 00:46:27.985
PLEASE BRING HIS NAME FORWARD TO

00:46:28.051 --> 00:46:29.086
THE DESK SO HE CAN BE

00:46:29.153 --> 00:46:30.687
APPROPRIATELY MEMORIALIZED IF

00:46:30.754 --> 00:46:31.889
THERE IS NO OTHER BUSINESS.

00:46:31.955 --> 00:46:34.424
SENATOR MCGUIRE, THE DESK IS

00:46:34.491 --> 00:46:36.293
CLEAR. THANK YOU SO MUCH, MADAM

00:46:36.360 --> 00:46:37.594
PRESIDENT. COLLEAGUES, I JUST

00:46:37.661 --> 00:46:39.496
WANT TO TAKE A MOMENT BEFORE WE

00:46:39.563 --> 00:46:40.597
ADJOURN TODAY TO BE ABLE TO

00:46:40.664 --> 00:46:41.698
ACKNOWLEDGE WHAT WE DID IN THE

00:46:41.765 --> 00:46:43.367
BEGINNING IS THE 80TH

00:46:43.433 --> 00:46:44.401
ANNIVERSARY OF D-DAY IN

00:46:44.468 --> 00:46:45.469
NORMANDY, FRANCE. 150,000

00:46:45.536 --> 00:46:48.672
MEMBERS OF OUR BRAVE ALLIED

00:46:48.739 --> 00:46:49.640
TROOPS JOINED TOGETHER IN THE

00:46:49.706 --> 00:46:52.042
LARGEST SEABORNE INVASION IN

00:46:52.109 --> 00:46:54.811
MILITARY HISTORY. 4000 DIED ON

00:46:54.878 --> 00:46:57.681
THAT FIRST DAY DEFENDING OUR

00:46:57.748 --> 00:47:00.350
DEMOCRACY AND OUR FREEDOMS AND

00:47:00.417 --> 00:47:02.152
ALL THOSE WHO CONTINUE TO SERVE

00:47:02.219 --> 00:47:04.288
THIS NATION IN OUR VETERANS,

00:47:04.354 --> 00:47:06.890
INCLUDING THOSE WHO SERVE THE

